[_description]
Package: com.snowgears.shop.util. EconomyUtils, InventoryUtils, Transaction utility classes. Bug sweep verified no issues in EconomyUtils, InventoryUtils, Transaction.

[_summary]
Utility classes for the Shop plugin. Provides helper methods for messaging, formatting, and common operations used across the plugin.

[_conclusions]
Utility classes are shared across main and test code, reducing duplication.

[_does]
Handles MiniMessage formatting, player messaging, and other utility functions used across main and test code.

